        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- TV Episodes: The Ricks Must Be Crazy, A Rickle in Time, The Wedding Squanchers\n- TV Series/Seasons: Rick and Morty season 2\n- People: Dan Guterman, Dominic Polcino\n- Networks/Blocks: Adult Swim, Cartoon Network\n\nFacts:\n- Rick and Morty season 2 premiered in the United States on July 26, 2015 on Cartoon Network's late-night programming block Adult Swim with the episode A Rickle in Time.\n- The Ricks Must Be Crazy was written by Dan Guterman and directed by Dominic Polcino.\n- The Ricks Must Be Crazy first aired on Adult Swim in the United States on August 30, 2015.\n- Rick and Morty season 2 concluded in the United States on October 4, 2015 with the episode The Wedding Squanchers.",
